{"synopsis":"Di dunia dimana runecraft muncul, ban terlahir dengan rune asura, rune yang paling terkutuk dalam sejarah, dikatakan hanya akan membawa kehancuran.\n\nSaat seorang penyihir yang mendambakan kekuatan menyerangnya, ban kehilangan segalanya dan disegel di dalam subspace, terputus dari dunia luar. Tenggelam dalam keputusasaan namun didorong oleh kemarahan yang tak terpadamkan, dia menolak untuk mati.\n\nSelama 999 tahun, dia mengasah pisau pembalasannya. Akhirnya, dia membuka kekuatan sejati Rune Asura, merobek penjaranya, dan kembali ke dunia, membawa kehancuran bersamanya.","alternative_title":"강한","author":"Kang Han","artist":"Kang Han","chapters":[{"number":"28","chapter":"28","slug":"77871ad4-b193-44d4-b5ab-f981130f4f30","date":"2026-02-07","images":[]},{"number":"27","chapter":"27","slug":"0101187f-6b0c-463f-a1a1-fdce62dd7284","date":"2026-02-07","images":[]},{"number":"26","chapter":"26","slug":"c6a9c89d-daa1-4535-b59a-59fdcfd012ef","date":"2026-02-07","images":[]},{"number":"25","chapter":"25","slug":"302d881a-1b8b-41a7-8eeb-8576aa42ad21","date":"2026-01-19","images":[]},{"number":"24","chapter":"24","slug":"eb09cdb2-3c2d-4ea2-8c46-8f78a545e8ef","date":"2026-01-06","images":[]},{"number":"23","chapter":"23","slug":"987a07ec-7da4-4811-953e-3fc421b5a3d9","date":"2026-01-05","images":[]},{"number":"22","chapter":"22","slug":"10775802-78b3-4268-9cee-0b0acfde292c","date":"2025-12-27","images":[]},{"number":"21","chapter":"21","slug":"4b02a728-565e-4dfe-8c96-87d601519480","date":"2025-12-18","images":[]},{"number":"20","chapter":"20","slug":"f8898596-a624-4b93-8208-fcbbaba175b0","date":"2025-12-18","images":[]},{"number":"19","chapter":"19","slug":"430a4d38-3aeb-4e72-965e-f7f53dd6606d","date":"2025-12-18","images":[]},{"number":"18","chapter":"18","slug":"776d2ceb-1267-4fda-a20c-9f0de21e945f","date":"2025-12-18","images":[]},{"number":"17","chapter":"17","slug":"03b60375-8d49-43b8-bf4e-c9dcaad195db","date":"2025-12-18","images":[]},{"number":"16","chapter